【ERCOT 2035-H2 Update: Post-RTC+B Performance and NPRR Duration-Stratified Accreditation】

Following international requests to share ERCOT's experience with duration-stratified capacity valuation, we offer the following observations from system operations and market data through 2035-H1:

1. RTC+B Co-Optimization Outcomes
Real-Time Co-optimization with Batteries has been in production since 2024. SCED dispatches batteries against energy, Reg-Up, Reg-Down, and ORS in a single optimization. The technology-neutral design has demonstrably improved dispatch efficiency and reduced the manual intervention previously required to manage battery State-ofCharge across ancillary and energy products.

2. NPRR1234 (Static Duration Stratification) - Operating Evidence
Our four-tier capacity valuation framework (2-4h, 4-8h, 8-24h, 24h+) has been operational since 2031. Key observed outcomes:
• 2-hour resources show marginalization risk as SCED clears them primarily for Reg-Down and short arbitrage;
• 4-8h resources capture the bulk of peak scarcity pricing and ORS deployment;
• 8h+ resources earn material scarcity premium during tight operating reserve events, but the absolute fleet remains small;
• Capacity accreditation differences between tiers are now large enough to influence project finance term sheets.

3. NPRR1236 (Dynamic Continuous-Time Accreditation)
The dynamic layer adjusts per-tier capacity values based on observed system need (load shape, renewable forecasts, contingency reserve deployment). Early operational data suggest the dynamic component narrows the gap between accredited capacity and actual peak contribution, but introduces non-trivial basis risk for merchant projects.

4. Honest Constraint Disclosure
Average merchant battery revenue remains materially below the levels observed before the 2023-2024 fleet expansion. The market is sending a signal: incremental identical 2-4h batteries into a saturated ancillary and short-duration arbitrage market will not clear project finance at current cost-of-capital. This is consistent with our long-stated concern that a market design relying solely on energy and ancillary revenues will underpay once services saturate.

5. Design Choices We Continue to Defend
• Technology-neutral dispatch (no technology carve-outs);
• Scarcity pricing through the Operating Reserve Demand Curve (ORDC), not administrative capacity contracts;
• Duration-stratified accreditation reflecting physical contribution;
• Reliability standards enforced through resource adequacy constructs, not capacity market procurement.

6. What We Are Watching
• Whether dynamic accreditation (NPRR1236) can support revenue recovery for marginal 2-4h projects without distorting price formation;
• Whether long-duration resources (8h+) achieve sufficient operating track record to attract non-recourse debt at merchant-only returns;
• Whether interconnection queue reform (in coordination with PUCT) can convert duration-diverse applications into operating assets at the pace required by system need.

ERCOT remains committed to competitive energy markets, operational flexibility, and scarcity-based price signals. Where the evidence shows revenue compression, we will adjust accreditation parameters; where it shows structural underpayment, we will work with PUCT and market participants on targeted design changes — without abandoning the merchant model that defines ERCOT.

— ERCOT Market Operations & System Planning

【国家发展改革委就新型储能项目"宣告容量—可交付容量"转换披露框架与运行数据硬约束作出部署】

PJM近期发布的容量市场五年回顾显示,4小时级储能ICAP信用已压缩至约77%,8小时以上长时资源维持99—100%——这一实证结果与国家能源局2031年上半年调度运行总结的发现高度一致。短时段储能边际收益递减、长时段资源可靠性贡献显性化,正在成为全球电力市场的共同事实。

为有序推进"十五五"长时段储能商业化扩面,国家发展改革委现就以下事项作出部署:

一、推行"宣告容量—可交付容量"分类披露体系。所有纳入省级以上规划的新型储能项目,均须按以下口径分阶段披露:
1. 已签约EPC且已开工——按0.85系数折算;
2. 已招标未签约——按0.55系数折算;
3. 仅在排队中——按0.30系数折算。
项目阶段、并网里程碑、独立性能验证、持续可用时长、调度履约、安全表现及成本等分类报告,作为国家与省级"十五五"规划执行的统一基线。

二、确立"独立验证运行数据"为非锂长时商业化的绑定性门槛。DOE Liftoff第三、四波数据集所确立的"独立第三方验证+连续24个月以上运营记录"标准,与NEA"四可"要求(可观、可测、可控、可调)在底层逻辑上一致。自本通知下发之日起,凡申报纳入国家或省级长时储能商业化名录的压缩空气、液流电池、铁空气、钠离子、热储能、氢储能及其他非锂技术路线项目,均须提交经国家级或国际同行认可的独立验证机构出具的连续运行数据;未提交者不进入商业化名录、不享受容量电价分档、不纳入财政补贴与税收优惠范围。

三、容量电价机制由静态三档向动态持续时间分层认证有序过渡。在既有静态三档(2—4小时/4—6小时/6小时以上)基础上,研究引入与系统供需变化、辅助服务市场饱和度、可再生能源消纳压力挂钩的动态系数调整机制,与PJM时长加权ICAP、ERCOT NPRR1236—1236动态校准形成方法论对接。短时段项目(2小时以下)容量电价边际递减已成定势,资源应向长时段、可调度、高可用方向迁移。

四、深化国际技术交流。在既有与FERC、AEMO、ERCOT、SECI、DOE对接的基础上,2036年技术交流重点为:
1. 项目转化披露体系的方法学互认;
2. 多日可靠性指标(>24小时)的工程参数对齐;
3. 非锂长时商业化的运行记录互认机制;
4. 动态时长分层认证系数的同行校准。

国家发展改革委将继续立足宏观规划与体制改革,统筹推进新型储能高质量发展。合规、可调度、可融资优先于装机速度——这是"十五五"评估各项工作的根本遵循。安全底线不动摇,系统观念不松懈,全国一盘棋推进新型电力系统构建。

